    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '<b>CONTROLS</b>

    W A S D / Arrows  -  walk (on foot) or drive (in
    a vehicle)

    Enter  -  ride / get off a vehicle (stop first)

    P  -  pick
    up customer / drop off customer

    Space  -  handbrake (while driving)

    Right
    mouse + drag  -  rotate camera (on foot)

    Esc  -  pause menu / back to the
    Item Shop

    M  -  mini map zoom'
